#: config.py:276
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The setting %(key)s is %(value)r and cannot be used as %(type)s, so it has "
"been left unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Lo paramètre %(key)s es %(value)r e pòt pas èsser utilizat coma %(type)s, "
"doncas es estat daissat inchangeat."

#: config.py:312
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The settings file %(filename)s could not be read in full. These settings "
"were restored: %(settings)s. The rest were reset to their defaults. A backup"
" has been saved as %(backup)s."
msgstr ""
"Lo fichièr de paramètres %(filename)s a pas pogut èsser legit entièrament. "
"Aquestes paramètres son estats restablits : %(settings)s. La rèsta foguèt "
"reïnicializada a sas valors per defaut. Una còpia de seguretat es estada "
"enregistrada coma %(backup)s."

#: config.py:323
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The settings file %(filename)s could not be read, so all settings have been "
"reset to their defaults. A backup of the original file has been saved as "
"%(backup)s."
msgstr ""
"Lo fichièr de paramètres %(filename)s a pas pogut èsser legit, doncas totes "
"los paramètres son estats restablits a lor valor per defaut. Una còpia de "
"seguretat del fichièr original es estada salvada coma %(backup)s."

