msgstr "Opcions generalas"

#: dialog/preferences.py:88
msgid "Open scanner at program start"
msgstr "Dobrir l’escanèr al lançament del programa"

#: dialog/preferences.py:91
msgid ""
"Automatically open the scan dialog in the background at program start. This "
"saves time clicking the scan button and waiting for the program to find the "
"list of scanners"
msgstr ""
"Dobrir automaticament lo dialòg d’escanejat en rèireplan al lançament del "
"programa. Aquò estalvia de temps en clicant sul boton d’escanejar e en "
"esperant que lo programa tròbe la lista dels escanèrs."

#: dialog/preferences.py:104
msgid "Device blacklist"
msgstr "Lista negra de dispositius"

#: dialog/preferences.py:107
msgid "e.g. Camera or v4l:.*"
msgstr "p. ex. Camèra o v4l:.*"

#: dialog/preferences.py:110
msgid ""
"Regular expression matched case-insensitively against the device label and "
"backend name, e.g. Camera or v4l:.*"
msgstr ""
"Expression regulara que correspond a l'etiqueta del dispositiu e al nom del "
"backend sens distincion de majusculas e minusculas, p. ex. Camèra o v4l:.*"

#: dialog/preferences.py:122
msgid "Cycle SANE handle after scan"
msgstr "Ciclar la maneta SANE aprèp l’escansatge"

#: dialog/preferences.py:124
msgid "Some ADFs do not feed out the last page if this is not enabled"
msgstr "D'unes ADFs fan pas sortir la darrièra pagina se aquò es pas activat"

#: dialog/preferences.py:132
msgid "Allow batch scanning from flatbed"
msgstr "Permetre l'escanejament per lot a partir del plat"

#: dialog/preferences.py:136
msgid ""
"If not set, switching to a flatbed scanner will force # pages to 1 and "
"single-sided mode."
msgstr ""
"Se es pas definit, lo passatge a un escanèr plat forçarà # paginas a 1 e lo "
"mòde de fàcia unica."

#: dialog/preferences.py:145
msgid "Ignore duplex capabilities of scanner"
msgstr "Ignorar las capacitats duplex de l'escàner"

#: dialog/preferences.py:149
msgid ""
"If set, any duplex capabilities are ignored, and facing/reverse widgets are "
"displayed to allow manual interleaving of pages."
msgstr ""
"Se definit, totas las capacitats recto-verso son ignoradas, e los gadjets "
"fàcia/revers son afichats per permetre l’intercalacion manuala de las "
"paginas."

#: dialog/preferences.py:158
msgid "Force new scan job between pages"
msgstr "Forçar un nòu trabalh d'escan entre las paginas"

#: dialog/preferences.py:162
msgid ""
"Otherwise, some Brother scanners report out of documents, despite scanning "
"from flatbed."
msgstr ""
"Autrament, d'unes escanèrs Brother senhalan una manca de documents, malgrat "
"l'escanejament dempuèi lo platèl."

#: dialog/preferences.py:178
msgid "Select # pages = all on selecting ADF"
msgstr "Seleccionar # paginas = totas en seleccionar ADF"

#: dialog/preferences.py:182
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, when switching to source=ADF, # pages = all is "
"selected"
msgstr ""
"Se aquesta opcion es activada, en passar a source=ADF, # paginas = totas es "
"seleccionat"

#: dialog/preferences.py:192
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, opening the scanner is quicker, as scantpaper "
"does not first search for available devices."
msgstr ""
"Se aquesta opcion es activada, dobrir l'escanèr es mai rapid, perque "
"scantpaper cerca pas d'en primièr los dispositius disponibles."

#: dialog/preferences.py:196
msgid ""
"This is only effective if the device names do not change between sessions."
msgstr ""
"Aquò es eficaç solament se los noms dels dispositius cambian pas entre las "
"sessions."

